{"title":"Notes","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Notes","pagetitle":"Notes · Duc (Bill) Le"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"sheet-meta\" data-sheet=\"05\" data-title=\"Notes\" data-top=\"3600\" data-bottom=\"4200\" hidden></div>\n<span class=\"label\">Sheet 05 · 3,600 to 4,200 ft</span>\n<p class=\"lede muted\" style=\"font-size:1.15rem;max-width:680px;margin-top:0.75rem\" data-vi=\"Những ghi chép ngắn về những gì mình học được khi làm mua hàng và phân tích dữ liệu.\">Short notes on things I've learned doing procurement and learning analytics. Around 300 words each.</p>\n\n<h2 data-vi=\"Bây giờ\">Now</h2>\n<ul class=\"now-list\">\n  <li><span>Oct 2026</span><span data-vi=\"Xây trang web này cho môn BZAN 6351, bằng R và Quarto.\">Building this site for BZAN 6351, in R and Quarto.</span></li>\n  <li><span>Oct 2026</span><span data-vi=\"Điều hành một công ty ngũ cốc muesli cùng nhóm trong game mô phỏng ERPsim.\">Running a muesli company with my team in the ERPsim game.</span></li>\n  <li><span>Oct 2026</span><span data-vi=\"Trợ giảng Solver và @Risk cho môn SCM 4330.\">Helping students with Solver and @Risk as an IA for SCM 4330.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 data-vi=\"Ghi chép\">Notes</h2>\n<div class=\"note-row\"><span class=\"when\">Draft</span><div><h3>What a late part costs when the tool has a ship date</h3><p>Why the price on the PO is rarely the real cost.</p></div><span class=\"status\">Soon</span></div>\n<div class=\"note-row\"><span class=\"when\">Draft</span><div><h3>Check the drawing revision before you place the order</h3><p>A small habit that saves a lot of rework.</p></div><span class=\"status\">Soon</span></div>\n<div class=\"note-row\"><span class=\"when\">Draft</span><div><h3>Learning R as a buyer</h3><p>What changed when I moved from Excel to code.</p></div><span class=\"status\">Soon</span></div>\n<p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;font-size:0.9rem\">These titles are placeholders. Swap in your own ideas.</p>\n```\n","src